const zamboangaPath='/councils/zamboanga-city/';
await mkdir(`dist${zamboangaPath}`, { recursive:true });
await writeFile(`dist${zamboangaPath}index.html`, layout({ title:'Zamboanga City Council', description:'Explore the Zamboanga City Council within the Tau Gamma Phi story, including its local history, communities, service, and preserved records.', path:zamboangaPath, crumbs:[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Councils',href:'/councils/'},{label:'Zamboanga City Council',href:zamboangaPath}], content:`<article class="reader"><p class="kicker">MINDANAO · LOCAL COUNCIL HISTORY</p><h1>Zamboanga City Council</h1><p class="reader-dek">Every council carries a story shaped by its people, communities, chapters, milestones, and service. In Zamboanga City, that local history forms part of the wider Tau Gamma Phi story while keeping the character of the city and its communities in view.</p><section><h2>Where the Local Story Connects</h2><p>Zamboanga belongs in the national story through the records, relationships, and contributions that can be traced to its local community. The material currently available introduces that connection without supplying unverified leadership rosters, event details, or service totals.</p></section><section><h2>From the Archive</h2><p>Photographs, documents, programmes, and community memories can help future readers understand how the council’s story developed over time. Each item is added with its own context and source.</p></section><section><h2>Continue Exploring</h2><p><a class="read-link" href="/councils/">Explore Councils</a> <a class="read-link" href="/chapters/">Explore Chapters</a> <a class="read-link" href="/service/">Discover Community Service</a> <a class="read-link" href="/archive/">Enter the Digital Archive</a></p></section></article>` }));
